# =========================================================================
# GST SENTINEL - ONLINE VERIFICATION CONFIGURATION (.env)
# =========================================================================
#
# This file configures live online verification for GSTIN and Vehicle (Vahan) lookups.
# If no keys or URLs are configured, the system seamlessly falls back to 100% free,
# offline statutory validation (Modulo-36 checksum, regex, PAN decoding, and RTO mappings).

# -------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. GSTIN ONLINE VERIFICATION (Choose Option A or Option B)
# -------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OPTION A: Using a free-trial provider API Key (e.g. Appyflow, GSTINAPI, Surepass)
# GSTIN_API_KEY=your_trial_key_here

# OPTION B: Using a custom API endpoint (e.g. internal service, RapidAPI, or web scraper)
# Use {gstin} placeholder where the GSTIN should be injected:
# GSTIN_API_URL=https://api.example.com/v1/gstin/{gstin}
# GSTIN_API_HEADER=x-api-key

# -------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. VAHAN (VEHICLE) ONLINE VERIFICATION
# -------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OPTION A: Using an API Key (e.g. Surepass, Cashfree Sandbox, Attestr, RapidAPI)
# VAHAN_API_KEY=your_trial_key_here

# OPTION B: Using a custom API endpoint
# Use {veh_num} placeholder where the vehicle number should be injected:
# VAHAN_API_URL=https://api.example.com/v1/rc/{veh_num}
# VAHAN_API_HEADER=Authorization
